@startuml sequence-uc08
title 图 2-9 UC-08 图文问诊 · 顺序图

skinparam {
  DefaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
  DefaultFontSize 11
  shadowing false
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  BorderColor #94A3B8
}

actor 患者 as P
actor 医生 as D
participant "OrderChatPanel" as UI
participant "MessageController" as CTRL
participant "MessageAppService" as SVC
participant "ConsultationOrder" as ORDER
participant "ConsultationMessage" as MSG
participant "MessageRepository" as REPO
database "MySQL" as DB

P -> UI : 输入文字，点击发送
UI -> CTRL : POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/messages
CTRL -> SVC : send(orderId, senderId, type, content)
SVC -> REPO : findOrderByIdAndParticipant(orderId, senderId)
REPO --> SVC : ORDER

alt 非订单参与人（患者本人 / 接诊医生之外）
  SVC --> CTRL : 404 NOT_FOUND
else 订单已结束或已取消
  SVC --> CTRL : 409 STATE_CONFLICT（会话只读）
else 内容为空或超过 1000 字
  SVC --> CTRL : 400 PARAM_INVALID
else 校验通过
  SVC -> ORDER : assertInConsultation()
  SVC -> MSG : create(senderId, senderRole, type, content, now)
  SVC -> REPO : save(message)
  REPO -> DB : INSERT consultation_message ...
  SVC --> CTRL : MessageVO
  CTRL --> UI : 200 { data }
end

D -> UI : 打开同一订单会话
UI -> CTRL : GET /api/v1/orders/{id}/messages?afterId=...
CTRL -> SVC : list(orderId, currentUserId, afterId)
SVC -> REPO : findByOrderIdAndIdGreaterThan(...)
REPO -> DB : SELECT ... ORDER BY id
REPO --> SVC : messages
SVC --> CTRL : 消息列表
CTRL --> UI : 200 { data }
UI --> D : 3 秒内显示新消息

note right of SVC
  图片消息先调用上传接口得到 imageUrl，
  再以 type=IMAGE、content=imageUrl 保存；
  消息表不存二进制文件。
end note
@enduml
